        "execution_id": "execution_bba94a12-fb23-4891-ba04-3f60bac24bee",
        "body": "The newest owner correction sets diagnostic retention at **53 hours** (superseding the earlier 48-hour statement). The unresolved question is **whether deletion leaves an audit tombstone**; no tombstone rule has been decided here.\n\nA group recommendation proposes an option for consideration. It is not an implementation assignment, which would explicitly authorize an owner, scope, and action. I have made no Task or code changes.",
